# Local security exception for SkillEvaluator 3fd2cf57e4a2af01f282e001f7515b6e76f18ec7.
# Its llm extra requires >=1.92.0,<1.94.0.dev0; this exact override intentionally
# conflicts with that unchanged upstream metadata. uv overrides replace every
# parent's LiteLLM constraint, so install_evaluator.py additionally validates the
# entire active extras graph and admits ONLY that exact evaluator requirement.
# uv pip check does not activate extras and cannot establish metadata consistency.
# Keyless compatibility: actual evaluator Bedrock invoke/converse and Harbor
# LiteLLM callers, mocking only provider HTTP; not live-model acceptance.
# Regenerate tier2.txt/tier3.txt with their recorded uv pip compile commands.
litellm==1.101.3
